    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "textbook-generic-declaration",
        "moduleId": "declaring-generic-class",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材：用占位符类型参数声明 class",
        "markdown": "教材用 `Vector3D<T>` 说明参数化 class 的声明方式：在类名后写出类型参数 `T`，类体内的字段与方法就可以用 `T` 代表一个尚未确定的类型。\n\n```java\nclass Vector3D<T> {\n  private T x;\n  private T y;\n  T getX() { return x; }\n  T getY() { return y; }\n  void setY(T ny) { y = ny; }\n}\n```\n\n`T` 不是某个具体类型，而是声明时留下的占位符；`x`、`y` 以及 `getX`、`getY`、`setY` 的签名都复用了这个占位符。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000039"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Creating Classes",
                "Creating Parameterised Types"
              ],
              "lineStart": 256,
              "lineEnd": 267,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "4b7589ab5083923088be85a13cb093d8b6b045ee939af96ea9ccb0e49d3950aa"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-why-placeholder",
        "moduleId": "declaring-generic-class",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：为什么用占位符而不是具体类型",
        "markdown": "如果不用类型参数，想分别存储 `Integer`、`Double`、`String` 的向量，就要为每种元素类型各写一个几乎相同的 class。引入 `T` 后，只需声明一次结构，具体元素类型留到创建对象时再指定，从而避免复制粘贴并保持类型一致。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-generic-declaration"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-placeholder-and-usage",
        "moduleId": "supplying-type-arguments",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材：T 只是惯用的占位符",
        "markdown": "教材强调：`T` 只是占位符，换用其他字母或词也可以，`T` 只是事实上的惯用选择。声明完成后，就可以像使用 `LinkedList<Integer>` 那样，用不同的底层存储类型创建 `Vector3D` 对象。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
