            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-type-argument-example",
        "moduleId": "supplying-type-arguments",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "模型示例：用类型实参创建对象",
        "markdown": "用类型实参替换占位符即可实例化：`Vector3D<Integer> ints = new Vector3D<>();` 与 `Vector3D<Double> doubles = new Vector3D<>();` 共享同一套 `Vector3D` 代码，但前者字段类型视为 `Integer`，后者视为 `Double`。调用 `setY` 时传入的参数应与类型实参一致。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-generic-declaration",
            "textbook-placeholder-and-usage"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-nested-multiple-parameters",
        "moduleId": "nesting-and-multiple-parameters",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材：嵌套类型与多类型参数",
        "markdown": "参数化类型本身也可以作为类型参数，例如 `LinkedList<Vector3D<Integer>>` 表示“元素为整数向量的列表”。教材还指出可以声明多个类型参数；Java 的 `Map` 就是常见例子，`TreeMap<String,Integer>` 用两个类型实参分别表示键和值的类型。",
